argin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软联手哈佛MIT发布生物学世界模型Project Quine并开启科研申请</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/049dadf42e5f697b56c1bd53c8e01875.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软研究院联合哈佛大学及麻省理工学院博德研究所，正式推出实验性多模态AI系统Project Quine。该系统被定位为生物学世界模型，旨在打通计算生物学建模与实验室湿实验。Quine的核心在于构建了覆盖基因组学、蛋白质、化学、细胞状态及生物成像的联合表征空间，通过交互式推理框架实现多领域信息的跨模态分析，解决了传统药物发现中各学科数据难以统一推理的瓶颈。在实际测试中，Project Quine表现出极高效率，仅用一个周末即筛出抗癌候选物，将药物筛选与验证周期从数月压缩至数天。该系统不仅能大幅降低科研成本，还为发现全新治疗路径提供了可能。目前，微软已启动首届Quine Fellows项目，开放科研人员申请抢先使用，后续计划将应用范围逐步扩展至商业化场景，推动AI在生命科学领域的深度落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab7742c19edc16283651a5f2488dbbf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 30, 202630Anthropic近日向部分合作伙伴披露其IPO招股说明书，计划以约2万亿美元的目标估值推进上市。数据显示，公司2025年营收同比增长12倍至近46亿美元，近三分之二来自美国市场，但同期运营亏损亦翻倍突破80亿美元。在商业化结构上，Claude模型以用量计费为主导，贡献约38亿美元收入，订阅业务仅实现7.89亿美元（占比不足20%）。招股书清晰显现出其对头部科技巨头的深度绑定:2025年，Anthropic通过亚马逊和谷歌云平台斩获21.6亿美元收入，营收占比由2023年的11%大幅攀升至47%，并为此支付约3.51亿美元渠道抽成。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与红帽等联合推进OCE1.0研发，打造面向AI代理的“企业级Kubernetes”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与红帽等联合推进OCE1.0研发，打造面向AI代理的“企业级Kubernetes”AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 30, 202631OpenAI、红帽（Red Hat）与英伟达等多方正联合开发开源智能体框架的企业级版本OpenClaw Enterprise（OCE1.0），旨在消除政企客户对自主 AI 代理的安全顾虑，该项目在社区中被定位为“面向代理的 Kubernetes”。该项目最初由 OpenAI 内部发起，现已捐赠给 OpenClaw 基金会统筹。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月访韩洽谈HBM4合作，三星有望进入AI加速器供应链</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4913ccd3981ba570d2bd86e12ae78ac2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰计划于下月访问韩国，与三星电子高层举行会谈，核心议题聚焦于AI芯片技术合作，三星有望正式成为AMD下一代AI加速器HBM4的内存供应商。双方此前于今年3月签署了围绕AI存储芯片与计算技术的谅解备忘录，此次会谈旨在将合作意向转化为实质性订单。HBM4作为AI加速器的关键内存层级，其供应稳定性直接决定了AMD旗舰芯片的产能与交付节奏。除三星外，苏姿丰此行还将接触韩国本土NPU企业，意在通过多元化布局，进一步强化AMD在AI算力链条中的核心竞争力，将内存及专用计算单元的命脉掌握在更可控的供应链版图中。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
